<html lang='en'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0' />
    <title>Project Quote</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 20px; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; } h1 { color: #007bff; } p
      { margin-bottom: 20px; } footer { margin-top: 20px; padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid #ccc; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <h1>Project Quote</h1>

      <p>Hello {{clientName}},</p>

      <p>We are pleased to provide you with a quote for your project. Below are
        the details:</p>

      <h2>Project Information:</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Project Name:</strong> {{projectName}}</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Please find the detailed quote document attached to this email.</p>

      <p>If you have any questions or need further clarification, feel free to
        reach out to us. We are looking forward to the opportunity to work with
        you on this project.</p>

      <footer>
        <p>Best Regards,<br />{{company_name}}</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>